---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Shift: a fast Gmail app for Mac" description="Shift is a fast, keyboard-friendly Gmail app for macOS. Several accounts in one inbox, and your mail stays on your Mac." path="/" appToggle>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap">
      <h1><span class="h1-logo" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/gmail.svg" alt="" width="88" height="66" /></span>Gmail at the speed of your Mac.</h1>
      <p>Shift keeps a copy of your mail on your Mac, so every account opens, searches and switches instantly. Coming soon for macOS.</p>
      <div id="get" class="actions">
        <div class="get" data-get>
        <button type="button" class="pill" data-get-open><span class="apple-logo" aria-hidden="true"></span>Ask for early access</button>
        <form class="get-form" hidden novalidate>
          <label class="sr-only" for="get-email-1">Email address</label>
          <input id="get-email-1" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" />
          <input class="hp" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />
          <button type="submit" class="pill">Get Shift</button>
        </form>
        <a class="pill" href="/download" hidden data-get-download><span class="apple-logo" aria-hidden="true"></span>Download for macOS</a>
        <p class="get-msg" role="status"></p>
      </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="stats" aria-label="Shift in numbers">
        <div><dt>download</dt><dd>15 MB</dd></div>
        <div><dt>memory in use</dt><dd>~120 MB</dd></div>
        <div><dt>native core</dt><dd>Rust</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Shift servers</dt><dd>0</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <div class="wrap">
      <!-- The app drawn in HTML with invented mail, so no real inbox is shown. -->
      <div class="stage hero-stage">
        <div class="app" role="img" aria-label="The Shift window: mailboxes, a message list and an open email">
          <div class="app-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="app-body">
            <div class="app-side">
              <span class="compose"><i class="ph ph-pencil-simple" aria-hidden="true"></i>New Email</span>
              <ul>
                <li class="on"><i class="ph ph-tray" aria-hidden="true"></i>Inbox<em>4</em></li>
                <li><i class="ph ph-push-pin" aria-hidden="true"></i>Pinned</li>
                <li><i class="ph ph-paper-plane-tilt" aria-hidden="true"></i>Sent</li>
                <li><i class="ph ph-file" aria-hidden="true"></i>Drafts</li>
                <li><i class="ph ph-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i>Scheduled</li>
                <li><i class="ph ph-archive" aria-hidden="true"></i>Archive</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="app-list">
              <div class="search"><i class="ph ph-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Search</div>
              <ol>
                <li class="on"><i class="av a">MR</i><b>Maya Reyes</b><time>9:41</time><span>Launch checklist for Thursday</span></li>
                <li><i class="av b">OS</i><b>Oak &amp; Stone Studio</b><time>9:12</time><span>Revised floor plans attached</span></li>
                <li><i class="av c">JL</i><b>Jonah Lee</b><time>Mon</time><span>Lunch next week?</span></li>
                <li><i class="av d">TP</i><b>Team Planning</b><time>Mon</time><span>Q1 roadmap draft</span></li>
                <li><i class="av e">NB</i><b>Northbank Bikes</b><time>Sun</time><span>Your service is booked</span></li>
              </ol>
            </div>
            <div class="app-reader">
              <h2>Launch checklist for Thursday</h2>
              <div class="from"><i class="av a">MR</i><span><b>Maya Reyes</b> to you, Sam</span></div>
              <p>Hi both,</p>
              <p>Here's where we are: copy is final, the store listing is approved, and the press note goes out at 9am.</p>
              <p>Could you check the screenshots one last time before noon?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="float float-left" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="float-title">Send later</div>
          <div class="opt on">Tomorrow morning<small>8:00 am</small></div>
          <div class="opt">This weekend<small>Sat 9:00 am</small></div>
          <div class="opt">Next week<small>Mon 8:00 am</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="float float-right" aria-hidden="true">
          <i class="ph ph-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>Archived<kbd>⌘Z</kbd>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="keys" aria-label="Some default shortcuts">
        <li><kbd>E</kbd>Archive</li>
        <li><kbd>R</kbd>Reply</li>
        <li><kbd>J</kbd><kbd>K</kbd>Next, previous</li>
        <li><kbd>/</kbd>Search</li>
        <li><kbd>⌘K</kbd>Commands</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <section id="features" class="row wrap">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>Every account.<br />One inbox.</h2>
        <p>Work and personal side by side, each with its own colour. Or look at one account at a time.</p>
        <ul class="points">
          <li><i class="ph ph-tray" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Unified inbox</b>Leave any account out of it in Settings.</li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-stack" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Smart Inbox</b>Pinned mail first, then new mail from people, then notifications, then what you've already read.</li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Instant search</b>Results appear as you type, from the copy on your Mac.</li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-bell" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Notifications that matter</b>Optionally only from people, not newsletters.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="stage">
        <div class="panel accounts" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="acct"><i class="dot blue"></i>sam@northbank.studio<em>12</em></div>
          <div class="acct"><i class="dot green"></i>sam.lee@gmail.com<em>3</em></div>
          <div class="acct"><i class="dot pink"></i>hello@samlee.design<em>1</em></div>
          <hr />
          <div class="mini"><i class="dot blue"></i><b>Maya Reyes</b><span>Launch checklist</span><time>9:41</time></div>
          <div class="mini"><i class="dot green"></i><b>Mum</b><span>Photos from Sunday</span><time>9:30</time></div>
          <div class="mini"><i class="dot pink"></i><b>Ari Novak</b><span>Logo feedback, round 2</span><time>8:55</time></div>
          <div class="mini"><i class="dot blue"></i><b>Jonah Lee</b><span>Lunch next week?</span><time>Mon</time></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="row center wrap">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>Hands stay on the keys.</h2>
        <p>Archive, reply, label and move without the mouse. Every shortcut can be remapped, and the defaults match Spark and Apple Mail.</p>
        <ul class="points">
          <li><i class="ph ph-command" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Command palette</b>Press ⌘K and type what you want to do.</li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-arrow-counter-clockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Undo</b>Archived the wrong thread? ⌘Z brings it back.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="stage">
        <div class="panel palette" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="palette-input"><i class="ph ph-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="query">ar</span><span class="caret"></span></div>
          <div class="cmds">
          <div class="cmd on"><i class="ph ph-archive" aria-hidden="true"></i>Archive<kbd>E</kbd></div>
          <div class="cmd"><i class="ph ph-envelope-simple-open" aria-hidden="true"></i>Mark read / unread<kbd>U</kbd></div>
          <div class="cmd"><i class="ph ph-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Search<kbd>/</kbd></div>
          <div class="cmd"><i class="ph ph-arrows-clockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i>Check for mail<kbd>⌘R</kbd></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="row flip wrap">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>Send it later.<br />Or take it back.</h2>
        <p>Write tonight and have it arrive in the morning. Shift sends it at the time you picked, even with the window closed.</p>
        <ul class="points">
          <li><i class="ph ph-paper-plane-tilt" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Undo send</b>The email waits on your Mac for a few seconds before it goes.</li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Trackers blocked</b>Remote images stay hidden until you load them.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="stage">
        <div class="panel composer" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="field"><span>To</span><i class="chip">maya@northbank.studio</i></div>
          <div class="field"><span>Subject</span>Screenshots checked</div>
          <p>All good on my end. Two small fixes in the second one, notes attached.</p>
          <div class="send-row">
            <span class="send">Send</span><span class="send-more"><i class="ph ph-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i>Tomorrow, 8:00 am</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="toast" aria-hidden="true">Sending in 5s<b>Undo</b></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="ai" class="row center wrap">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>AI when you want it.</h2>
        <p>Bring your own AI account, from Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, a local model or another provider. It's off until you add one, and requests go straight from your Mac to that provider.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bento">
        <div class="stage bento-card">
          <h3><i class="ph ph-pencil-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>Write and reply</h3>
          <p>Draft a reply from a few notes, or tidy up what you wrote.</p>
          <div class="panel" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="cmd on"><i class="ph ph-arrow-bend-up-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>Draft a reply</div>
            <div class="cmd"><i class="ph ph-magic-wand" aria-hidden="true"></i>Improve writing</div>
            <div class="cmd"><i class="ph ph-text-aa" aria-hidden="true"></i>Make shorter</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stage bento-card">
          <h3><i class="ph ph-tag" aria-hidden="true"></i>Labels that sort themselves</h3>
          <p>Describe your labels once. New mail is labelled as it arrives, and one click undoes it.</p>
          <div class="panel ai-labels" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="mini"><i class="dot blue"></i><b>Northbank</b><span>Invoice #2048</span><i class="chip">Invoice</i></div>
            <div class="mini"><i class="dot green"></i><b>Ari Novak</b><span>Logo feedback</span><i class="chip">Clients</i></div>
            <div class="mini"><i class="dot pink"></i><b>Jonah Lee</b><span>Lunch next week?</span><i class="chip">Personal</i></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stage bento-card">
          <h3><i class="ph ph-broom" aria-hidden="true"></i>Clean up your Inbox</h3>
          <p>Shift suggests what to archive. Nothing moves until you say so.</p>
          <div class="panel" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="mini"><i class="dot blue"></i><b>Newsletters</b><span>12 emails</span><time>Archive</time></div>
            <div class="mini"><i class="dot green"></i><b>Receipts</b><span>5 emails</span><time>Archive</time></div>
            <div class="mini"><i class="dot pink"></i><b>Old threads</b><span>8 emails</span><time>Archive</time></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="privacy" class="band">
      <div class="row center wrap">
      <div class="row-text">
        <h2>Your Mac, Google, and nothing else.</h2>
        <p>Your mail travels one way: straight between your Mac and Gmail. Shift has nothing in the middle to read it, store it or lose it. Turn on AI and only the AI provider you chose joins in.</p>
        <ul class="points">
          <li><i class="ph ph-hard-drives" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>No Shift servers</b>No account to create, and no copy of your mail anywhere but your Mac.</li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-key" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Sign-in in the Keychain</b>macOS keeps your Google sign-in, the same way it keeps your passwords.</li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-eye-slash" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>No analytics</b>Shift collects nothing about how you use it and shows no ads.</li>
          <li><i class="ph ph-wifi-slash" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Works offline</b>Read, archive and label on a plane. Changes reach Gmail when you're back online.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="stage">
        <div class="flow" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="node">
            <span class="tile"><img src="/icon.png" alt="" width="256" height="256" /></span>
            <b>Your Mac</b>
            <span class="tag"><i class="ph ph-database"></i>Mail stored here</span>
            <span class="tag"><i class="ph ph-key"></i>Sign-in in Keychain</span>
          </div>
          <div class="wire"><i class="packet"></i><i class="packet back"></i><small><i class="ph ph-lock-simple"></i>Direct, encrypted</small></div>
          <div class="node">
            <span class="tile"><img src="/gmail.svg" alt="" width="88" height="66" /></span>
            <b>Gmail</b>
            <span class="tag"><i class="ph ph-envelope-simple"></i>Your mail stays in Google</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing wrap">
      <img src="/icon.png" alt="" width="88" height="88" />
      <h2>Try Shift early.</h2>
      <p>Shift is in testing now. Leave your email and download the latest build.</p>
      <div class="get" data-get>
        <button type="button" class="pill" data-get-open><span class="apple-logo" aria-hidden="true"></span>Ask for early access</button>
        <form class="get-form" hidden novalidate>
          <label class="sr-only" for="get-email-2">Email address</label>
          <input id="get-email-2" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" />
          <input class="hp" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />
          <button type="submit" class="pill">Get Shift</button>
        </form>
        <a class="pill" href="/download" hidden data-get-download><span class="apple-logo" aria-hidden="true"></span>Download for macOS</a>
        <p class="get-msg" role="status"></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
